           The value 0 has the same meaning as value _n_e_v_e_r - the access will
           not be re-enabled without resetting the faillock entries by the
           ffaaiilllloocckk(8) command. The default is 600 (10 minutes).

           Note that the default directory that _p_a_m___f_a_i_l_l_o_c_k uses is usually
           cleared on system boot so the access will be also re-enabled after
